        {
            "type": "html",
            "html": "  <section>\n    <div class=\"container-custom\">\n      <div class=\"section-header text-center mx-auto\" data-aos=\"fade-up\">\n        <span class=\"section-eyebrow justify-content-center\">Garment Applications</span>\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">Seven Garment Categories, One Consistent Standard</h2>\n        <p class=\"section-subtitle mx-auto\">Every garment category places a different demand on interlining — some need stiffness, some need wash durability, some need moulded shape. Here's how our product range maps to each.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row g-4\">\n        <div class=\"col-lg-3 col-md-6\" data-aos=\"fade-up\">\n          <div class=\"product-card\">\n            <div class=\"product-img\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1603252109612-24fa03d145c8?w=600&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop\" alt=\"Formal shirts requiring collar and cuff interlining\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n            <div class=\"product-body\">\n              <span class=\"product-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-tshirt me-1\"></i>Shirts</span>\n              <h3>Shirts &amp; Formalwear</h3>\n              <p>Our <a href=\"/product/collar-cuff.html\">readymade collar &amp; cuff</a> paired with <a href=\"/product/fusible-interlining.html\">fusible interlining</a> gives a crisp collar roll and a cuff edge that stays sharp through repeated ironing and washing.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-lg-3 col-md-6\" data-aos=\"fade-up\" data-aos-delay=\"100\">\n          <div class=\"product-card\">\n            <div class=\"product-img\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1742535038295-57e2a54809b3?w=600&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop\" alt=\"Institutional uniforms requiring durable interlining\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n            <div class=\"product-body\">\n              <span class=\"product-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-user-tie me-1\"></i>Uniforms</span>\n              <h3>School &amp; Corporate Uniforms</h3>\n              <p><a href=\"/product/fusible-interlining.html\">Fusible interlining</a> and <a href=\"/product/pocketing-fabric.html\">pocketing cloth</a> are built to survive institutional laundering cycles without delaminating or losing shape.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-lg-3 col-md-6\" data-aos=\"fade-up\" data-aos-delay=\"200\">\n          <div class=\"product-card\">\n            <div class=\"product-img\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600091166971-7f9faad6c1e2?w=600&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop\" alt=\"Blazers requiring shoulder pad and chest structure\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n            <div class=\"product-body\">\n              <span class=\"product-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-vest me-1\"></i>Blazers</span>\n              <h3>Blazers &amp; Jackets</h3>\n              <p><a href=\"/product/shoulder-pad.html\">Shoulder pads</a> combined with <a href=\"/product/fusible-interlining.html\">fusible interlining</a> build the chest, lapel and shoulder structure a tailored blazer needs to hold its line.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-lg-3 col-md-6\" data-aos=\"fade-up\" data-aos-delay=\"300\">\n          <div class=\"product-card\">\n            <div class=\"product-img\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1609259886986-a642e7e1dbf9?w=600&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop\" alt=\"Trousers requiring pocketing cloth and waistband support\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n            <div class=\"product-body\">\n              <span class=\"product-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-socks me-1\"></i>Trousers</span>\n              <h3>Trousers &amp; Bottomwear</h3>\n              <p><a href=\"/product/pocketing-fabric.html\">Pocketing cloth</a> reinforces pocket bags against tearing, while <a href=\"/product/belt-roll.html\">belt roll &amp; placket (patti)</a> keeps the waist edge firm through daily wear.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-lg-3 col-md-6\" data-aos=\"fade-up\">\n          <div class=\"product-card\">\n            <div class=\"product-img\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1720534490358-bc2ad29d51d5?w=600&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop\" alt=\"Caps requiring buckram for shape-holding structure\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n            <div class=\"product-body\">\n              <span class=\"product-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-hat-cowboy me-1\"></i>Caps</span>\n              <h3>Caps &amp; Headwear</h3>\n              <p><a href=\"/product/buckram-fabric.html\">Buckram fabric</a> gives the crown and peak the stiffness needed to hold shape wear after wear, wash after wash.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-lg-3 col-md-6\" data-aos=\"fade-up\" data-aos-delay=\"100\">\n          <div class=\"product-card\">\n            <div class=\"product-img\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1741183397795-324643563b7f?w=600&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop\" alt=\"Industrial workwear requiring heavy-duty interlining\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n            <div class=\"product-body\">\n              <span class=\"product-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-industry me-1\"></i>Industrial</span>\n              <h3>Industrial Garments</h3>\n              <p>Heavy-duty <a href=\"/product/pocketing-fabric.html\">pocketing cloth</a> and <a href=\"/product/fusible-interlining.html\">fusible interlining</a> are specified where workwear faces daily abrasion, not occasional wear.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-lg-3 col-md-6\" data-aos=\"fade-up\" data-aos-delay=\"200\">\n          <div class=\"product-card\">\n            <div class=\"product-img\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1593030103066-0093718efeb9?w=600&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop\" alt=\"Fashion garments requiring varied interlining structure\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n            <div class=\"product-body\">\n              <span class=\"product-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-scissors me-1\"></i>Fashion</span>\n              <h3>Fashion &amp; Design-Led Garments</h3>\n              <p>Design-driven silhouettes draw on <a href=\"/product/buckram-fabric.html\">buckram</a>, <a href=\"/product/fusible-interlining.html\">fusible interlining</a> or <a href=\"/product/eva-foam.html\">EVA foam</a> depending on how much structure the piece calls for.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-lg-3 col-md-6 d-flex\" data-aos=\"fade-up\" data-aos-delay=\"300\">\n          <div class=\"card-custom d-flex flex-column align-items-center justify-content-center text-center p-4 bg-navy w-100\">\n            <i class=\"fas fa-comments fa-2x text-gold mb-3\"></i>\n            <h3 class=\"text-white h5 mb-2\">Not Sure Which Product Fits?</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-white-50 small mb-3\">Describe your garment and construction — we'll recommend the right product and specification.</p>\n            <a href=\"/contact.html\" class=\"btn btn-gold btn-sm-custom\">Talk To Us</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>",
            "label": "Seven Garment Categories, One Consistent Standard"
        },
